WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
An agent can finish the task and still take unhelpful steps.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:11.000
PRL puts a Python function between rollout and advantage computation.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Reweight steps or text spans. Mask what you do not want to learn.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Rewrite reasoning, commands, or outputs. Edited text can be context
only.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Replay a prefix, let the policy continue, and train on the new samples.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Use Reweight, Rewrite, and Reroll in your own transform.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Start with PRL. Try a transform of your own.
